WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
I'm just honored to be mentioned on a legacy show,

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.530
like "Broad City",

3
00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:07.285
please welcome, Abbi Jacobson.

4
00:00:07.285 --> 00:00:10.535
(audience applauding)

5
00:00:11.979 --> 00:00:12.812
I'm not kidding,

6
00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:15.920
I would like to thank you for the cred.

7
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.687
No, it is my absolute honor.

8
00:00:18.687 --> 00:00:22.550
We talked about you all the time in the writer's room.

9
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.370
It was our pleasure to put you on the show

10
00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:27.250
as much as humanly possible.

11
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.310
So yeah, I haven't seen that in a second,

12
00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:32.080
I miss doing that.

13
00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.890
Now your beautiful partner,

14
00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:38.770
the great Ilana Glazer is about to be a mom.

15
00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:39.700
Yes.

16
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:40.930
How is that?

17
00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:42.580
It's incredible.

18
00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:44.920
She's been talking about this for a long time.

19
00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:47.961
She came over here with her partner,

20
00:00:47.961 --> 00:00:52.400
and they told me they're so excited,

21
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.400
she's going to be such an incredible mom.

22
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:59.400
She has a lot of like mom energy already, I think.

23
00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.860 line:15%
She's very motherly,

24
00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:07.860 line:15%
but it's just been really adorable to see her belly grow,

25
00:01:08.387 --> 00:01:09.220 line:15%
(Abbi coughing)

26
00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:10.053 line:15%
Sorry guys.

27
00:01:10.952 --> 00:01:13.240 line:15%
But I wish I was just getting choked up,

28
00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.346 line:15%
but there was just something in my throat.

29
00:01:15.346 --> 00:01:18.300
(Drew laughing)

30
00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.670
We were in the same city for a while and now we're not

31
00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:23.000
and so I just get a lot of FaceTimes,

32
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.140
and pictures of her belly growing, but it's,

33
00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:29.030
I mean Ilana is like this little person anyway,

34
00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:32.170
it's so cute to watch her get bigger.

35
00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:35.620
Well, and you are really close with your mom, right?

36
00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:36.453
I am, yes.

37
00:01:36.453 --> 00:01:39.610
I'm seeing my mom tomorrow for Mother's Day early.

38
00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:41.823
I love that you're close with your mom.

39
00:01:42.855 --> 00:01:44.200
What are you guys gonna do?

40
00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.280
I don't even know.

41
00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:46.470
We'll just hang out,

42
00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:48.910
going to have a dinner in the backyard I think

43
00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:50.583
with my brother and his kids,

44
00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:55.230
I got her a really cute shirt and some socks,

45
00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:57.790
but don't tell her until she opens it.

46
00:01:57.790 --> 00:01:59.290
I won't tell her a thing.

47
00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:03.420
and now you are adapting "A League of Their Own".

48
00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:05.590
I mean, how cool is this?

49
00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:09.860
And I heard you actually got to talk to Penny Marshall

50
00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:14.790
before she departed this planet with her amazing gifts

51
00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:17.210
that she'd be stowed upon it.

52
00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:18.250
It was pretty incredible.

53
00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:21.210
I mean, Will Graham asked me to do this project with him

54
00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:22.770
and we got the opportunity

55
00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:26.900 line:15%
to jump on the phone with her really to get her blessing

56
00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:29.750 line:15%
and to just ask her about the experience and.

57
00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:30.970 line:15%
Okay, but that's perfect.

58
00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:33.560
That like, what was penny Marshall's blessing?

59
00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:34.950
What did it sound like?

60
00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:35.783
Paint the scene.

61
00:02:35.783 --> 00:02:36.616
I got it.

62
00:02:36.616 --> 00:02:37.670
Okay, perfect.

63
00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:41.850
She goes, well umm,

64
00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:44.614
go and do it already and go and do it,

65
00:02:44.614 --> 00:02:47.364
and I was like okay, that was it.

66
00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:52.010
Yeah, she was so sweet and supportive.

67
00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:54.130
You know, this is like,

68
00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:58.290
it's a very much a re-imagining of the film.

69
00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:01.430
We are doing sort of a re-examining of what it was like.

70
00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:03.340
We're telling a lot of stories of what it was like

71
00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:05.070
for women who wanted to,

72
00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:06.430
who had the dream to play baseball

73
00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:11.100
so yes, it's like a door opens for a lot of white women

74
00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:12.260
and white passing women

75
00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:14.950
that get on the league that we all know from the film.

76
00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:17.210
But what about the black women

77
00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:18.860
who were not allowed to try out

78
00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:21.330
and who had to sort of carve their own path

79
00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:23.080
to play baseball?

80
00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:26.320
It's also a really queer story,

81
00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:29.991
which I know it's wild to imagine that

82
00:03:29.991 --> 00:03:33.720
women playing professional baseball might have been queer,

83
00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:35.180
but they were,

84
00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:38.900 line:15%
and that sort of wasn't part of the film.

85
00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:41.910 line:15%
So we're really trying to keep the spirit

86
00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:44.560 line:15%
and the joy that the film has.

87
00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:47.690
And just open up the lens to tell a lot more stories

88
00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:50.160
and a lot more of the realities

89
00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:52.610
of what was really going on in 1943.

90
00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:55.890
Okay I have to talk to you before we go

91
00:03:55.890 --> 00:04:00.700
about your new film that I'm so obsessed with

92
00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:02.973
The Mitchells vs. The Machines.

93
00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:07.110
I want to tell you one of the reasons why I love it so much

94
00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:11.920
is because it was one of the first films that I'm seeing

95
00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:15.570
that feels like it represents what my family is really like.

96
00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:18.870
And I just thank you so much for making this movie

97
00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:20.760
for families out there.

98
00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:23.030
And I would love to show a clip

99
00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.470
of The Mitchells vs. the Machines,

100
00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:27.843
I just I'm so excited.

101
00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:32.530
Play it safe?

102
00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:35.020
When Rick Mitchell brought a live non-neutered,

103
00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:38.100
feral possum into our home, did he play it safe?

104
00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:41.520
No, he named him Gus and made him a member of the family

105
00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:43.760
and we all got rabies at one time.

106
00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:46.906
But now we're immunized and we're stronger for it.

107
00:04:46.906 --> 00:04:48.380
(audience laughing)

108
00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.760
Abbi I'm so honored to hang out with you.

109
00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:55.370
The Mitchells vs. The Machines is available now on Netflix

110
00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:58.090
and it's my highest recommendation

111
00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:01.590
for families to get together and watch this awesome,

112
00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:05.730
real, humorous, bad-ass adventure that you've made.

113
00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:07.510
Thank you so much.

114
00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:08.920
Thank you so much for having me.

115
00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:10.922
What a pleasure really.

116
00:05:10.922 --> 00:05:13.589 line:15%
(upbeat music)

